<title>FRANCE: ATHLETICS-WORLD INDOOR, HALVARI 2ND IN QUALIFICATION.</title>
<headline>ATHLETICS-WORLD INDOOR, HALVARI 2ND IN QUALIFICATION.</headline>
<dateline>PARIS 1997-03-07</dateline>
<text>
<p>Results on the opening day of the</p>
<p>world indoor championships on Friday:</p>
<p>Men's shot put, group one (first three qualify for the</p>
<p>final)</p>
<p> 1. John Godina (U.S.)				20.46 metres</p>
<p> 2. Mika Halvari (Finland)			  20.04</p>
<p> 3. Manuel Martinez (Spain)			 19.96</p>
<p> 4. Kjell Ove Hauge (Norway)			19.78</p>
<p> 5. Yuriy Bilonoh (Ukraine)			 19.62</p>
<p> 6. Corrado Fantini (Italy)			 19.59</p>
<p> 7. Michael Mertens (Germany)		     19.43</p>
<p> 8. Dmitri Goncharuk (Belarus)		    19.43</p>
<p> 9. Mark Proctor (Britain)			  19.21</p>
<p> 10. Fernando Alves (Portugal)		    18.98</p>
<p> 11. Pavel Chumachenko (Russia)		   18.88</p>
